# The Rainbow Springs treasure chests. AzitWateringMimic (35593) fights back at the character
# hitting it, by the damage over its level plus 7: a hit of 22 on a level 1 chest wants an attack
# of 22 / 8 * 100 = 275. AzitWateringMimicMagical (35594), at each hit, wants to cast its DD magic
# at the attacker on a draw under 1 of 9, walking to it: not on a draw of 1, on one of 0. Its
# vanishing once the cast lands is in tests/ai/hall_watering_test.go.
character Hunter 20
random 1 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringMimic
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringMimicMagical
npc mimic 35593 Monster 40 0 0
npc magic 35594 Monster -40 0 0 skill DD_MAGIC 4992 1

hit mimic 22
  desires mimic attack(player)=275
hit magic 22
  desires magic -
hit magic 22
  desires magic cast(player,4992,move)=1000000
